Bars","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Breakfast & Brunch, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"otlORLZ8uZM3_orBFl2z7w","review_id":"k-gAPi-SqBZoR0pgY13R9g","date":"2016-02-19T02:30:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9339878559112549,"text_excerpt":"We picked this place for lunch because it was across the street from this funky pet shop and were hungry. Turns out to have been a great choice! They have a variety of Cuban lunches and cocktails. I ordered the El Presidente cocktail and it was quite good. I prefer to taste the alcohol in my cocktails and have them not be overly sweet. El Presidente is exactly that kind of cocktail. For lunch, I ordered the vegetarian Cuban sandwich which was on French bread with black beans, avocado, and cheese (I ordered no cheese). For being so healthy, that sandwich was PACKED with flavor! My sister took a tasting bite and was instantly jealous that she hadn't ordered the sandwich. Great spot-- get lu..."},{"business_id":"otlORLZ8uZM3_orBFl2z7w","review_id":"tpQYnTjn6Bw90GBrspukqw","date":"2016-03-13T16:29:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9337422847747803,"text_excerpt":"This place is a gem! I'm originally from FL and when I moved here I was majorly bummed that there wasn't much of a Cuban food selection. I would say that I was having major Cuban sandwich withdrawals and then someone told me about this little place in the quarter. I went a few weekends ago and I was not disappointed! It's delish! The Cuban definitely hit the spot and I will absolutely be returning. The daiquiri was just icing on the cake."},{"business_id":"otlORLZ8uZM3_orBFl2z7w","review_id":"46_6kt7kJQpUmgd7gnfZyw","date":"2016-01-07T05:24:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9324721097946167,"text_excerpt":"I found out about this place on Eater and had to visit. I'm glad I did. The place itself is not huge, the menu is small as well but the simple flavors and delivery are massive. I ordered a Mojito, a Cuban sandwich and the drunk tres leches. While waiting for my order I had a very pleasant back and forth chat with the two co-owners. The sandwich was very good. Very tasty with the right amoint.of crunch agter being presed. The drink was made well and was had the right amount amount of alchol. The Tres Leches was FANTASTIC. Probably top three I've ever had. I would recommend stopping in to show some love and definitely getting a piece of the Tres Leches cake."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"otlORLZ8uZM3_orBFl2z7w","photo_id":"Fzkb6HaJpIW7osX7Hflh4Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Fzkb6HaJpI